layer":"original","quote":"九月，公还许。绍之未破也，使刘备略汝南；汝南贼共都等应之〖4〗。遣蔡扬击都，不利，为都所破。公南征备。备闻公自行，走奔刘表；都等皆散。","section_title":"武帝纪第一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0007_split_000.xhtml","index":457,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":67},{"id":"wudi-q-b-9c802125724c98d43dbe","section":"chapter-001","block":"b-9c802125724c98d43dbe","layer":"modern","quote":"〖1〗六年：建安六年（公元 201）。","section_title":"武帝纪第一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0007_split_000.xhtml","index":460,"anchor":null},"note_id":"n-9b6cfac8aaa83b85aeb7","start":0,"end":19},{"id":"wudi-q-o083","section":"chapter-001","block":"b-1558c8ed4ee1b2768986","layer":"original","quote":"六年夏四月〖1〗，扬兵河上〖2〗。击绍仓亭军〖3〗，破之。绍归，复收散卒，攻定诸叛郡县。","section_title":"武帝纪第一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0007_split_000.xhtml","index":456,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":44},{"id":"wudi-q-o084","section":"chapter-001","block":"b-f1ba2e0f53a15df9cff8","layer":"original","quote":"九月，公还许。绍之未破也，使刘备略汝南；汝南贼共都等应之〖4〗。遣蔡扬击都，不利，为都所破。公南征备。备闻公自行，走奔刘表；都等皆散。","section_title":"武帝纪第一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0007_split_000.xhtml","index":457,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":67},{"id":"xianzhu-e-o021a-q","section":"chapter-032","block":"b-89994d2c61c1d14e6400","layer":"original","quote":"绍遣先主将本兵复至汝南；与贼龚都等合，众数千人。","section_title":"先主传第二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0070.xhtml","index":92,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":24},{"id":"xianzhu-e-o021b-q","section":"chapter-032","block":"b-89994d2c61c1d14e6400","layer":"original","quote":"曹公遣蔡杨击之，为先主所杀。","section_title":"先主传第二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0070.xhtml","index":92,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":24,"end":38},{"id":"xianzhu-e-o021c-q","section":"chapter-032","block":"b-89994d2c61c1d14e6400","layer":"original","quote":"曹公既破绍，自南击先主。","section_title":"先主传第二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0070.xhtml","index":92,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":38,"end":50},{"id":"xianzhu-e-o022a-q","section":"chapter-032","block":"b-2d6f229edbd08467d35a","layer":"original","quote":"先主遣麋竺、孙乾，与刘表相闻〖6〗。表自郊迎〖7〗，以上宾礼待之；益其兵，使屯新野。","section_title":"先主传第二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0070.xhtml","index":93,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":42},{"id":"xianzhu-f0037-q","section":"chapter-032","block":"b-89994d2c61c1d14e6400","layer":"original","quote":"龚都","section_title":"先主传第二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0070.xhtml","index":92,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":14,"end":16},{"id":"xianzhu-q-o021","section":"chapter-032","block":"b-89994d2c61c1d14e6400","layer":"original","quote":"绍遣先主将本兵复至汝南；与贼龚都等合，众数千人。曹公遣蔡杨击之，为先主所杀。曹公既破绍，自南击先主。","section_title":"先主传第二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0070.xhtml","index":92,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":50},{"id":"xumisun-q-727212c1a286e8fa4d24","section":"chapter-038","block":"b-7adb7d1923d89c2c9673","layer":"original","quote":"将适荆州，乾又与麋竺俱使刘表：皆如意指","section_title":"许麋孙简伊秦传第八","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0082.xhtml","index":200,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":14,"end":33}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
